    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">360‑Degree Digital Condition Audit</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Capture high‑resolution photos of the bike from all angles, noting scratches, dents, and any existing wear. Record mileage, chassis number, and engine condition in a digital log. This audit creates a verifiable baseline that both the owner and the packers‑and‑movers in Rajkot can reference after delivery.</p>
