    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Additional Safety Measures</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Wrap the motorcycle in a breathable cover, secure the handlebars with soft straps, and place protective padding around vulnerable parts such as the mirrors and exhaust. For bike shifting in train, ensure the crate meets railway specifications and label it clearly with “Fragile – Two‑Wheeler”.</p>
